w("refusal.ADDRESSEE_REFUSED", "An addressee is an office by its role and body, a reporter or outlet, an organization or another civic group by role and organization, or a described audience. It is never a private individual. Nothing was written.", note="action-plans' translation, keyed by its code")
w("refusal.ADOPTION_MODE_UNKNOWN", "An adoption is by reference, voluntary or by accreditation. This one names none of these. Nothing was written.", note="standards' translation, keyed by its code")
